<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Schlumberger upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Schlumberger upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers analyst Michael LaMotte said he upgraded Schlumberger Ltd to short-term buy from hold, and kept the long-term outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- raised the earnings estimate to $4.20 from $4 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1997 price target to $105 from $100. Shares rose 1-3/8 to 83-1/2.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;this is a very good entry point for (buying) the stock...&quot;</p>
</text>
